PictoKeyboard downloads pictograms on demand from the ARASAAC API
(https://api.arasaac.org) and the static CDN (https://static.arasaac.org).
The pictogram images are not redistributed with the application binary.

This attribution is also shown to end users in the app's "About & credits"
screen, as required by the ARASAAC terms of use.
